  "description": "Helpers for unit testing Blazor components, packaged from Steve Sanderson's BlazorUnitTestingPrototype, which he published as source only:\nhttps://blog.stevensanderson.com/2019/08/29/blazor-unit-testing-prototype/\nhttps://github.com/SteveSandersonMS/BlazorUnitTestingPrototype\nNote that bUnit grew out of the same prototype and is the actively maintained option; prefer it for new test suites.",
