  "releaseNotes": "Modernised for .NET 10, and multi-targeted so .NET 8 projects have a working version too. netstandard2.1 and net5.0 are no longer supported.\nFixed: version 1.0.0 did not work on .NET 5 or later at all, despite advertising .NET 5 support. Duplicate PackageReference items meant both of its builds were compiled against ASP.NET Core 3.1, whose RenderTreeFrame exposed public fields that later became properties, so rendering a component threw MissingFieldException at runtime.",
